data: {"node":"go-bench","run":"f871bc2e36bff1a5addfa7e742c170c0","text":"```go\npackage main\n\nimport (\n\t\"math/rand\"\n\t\"sort\"\n\t\"testing\"\n)\n\nfunc BenchmarkMergeSort10k(b *testing.B) {\n\tr := rand.New(rand.NewSource(42))\n\tinput := make([]int64, 10000)\n\tfor i := range input {\n\t\tinput[i] = r.Int63()\n\t}\n\twant := append([]int64(nil), input...)\n\tsort.Slice(want, func(i, j int) bool { return want[i] < want[j] })\n\n\tb.ReportAllocs()\n\tb.ResetTimer()\n\tfor i := 0; i < b.N; i++ {\n\t\tgot := MergeSort(input)\n\t\tif len(got) != len(want) {\n\t\t\tb.Fatalf(\"len = %d, want %d\", len(got), len(want))\n\t\t}\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n```\ngo test -bench=BenchmarkMergeSort10k -benchmem -run=^$ -count=5\n```"}

